To avoid modifying `analyzepsbt`, I think we could modify `SignPSBTInput` so when having inputs final script_sig or final script_witness it verifies that the scripts are valid. In case the verification fails it would return an error which would cause the `next` field in `analyzepsbt` to return `updater` instead of `finalizer`. However, I haven't checked this last case.
